.SH "WHERE TO FIND HOOKS AND APIS"
.IX Header "WHERE TO FIND HOOKS AND APIS"
.IP "global API" 4
.IX Item "global API"
Test2::API is the global API. This is primarily used by plugins that provide
global behavior.
